":{"lineHeight":1.8,"paddingLeft":20,"margin":0},"children":[["$","li","Hurrah Rose Star Petunie-1–13-Blütenzentrum",{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["1–13"," (Blütenzentrum)",":"]}]," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"display":"inline-block","width":34,"height":14,"borderRadius":7,"background":"#CDC5C2","border":"1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.18)","verticalAlign":"middle","marginRight":6}}],"Lass weiß mit einem Kreola Silberumriss"," — Das Sternmuster dieser Sorte beginnt als ein blasses Zentrum."]}],["$","li","Hurrah Rose Star Petunie-14–27-Rüschige Blüte",{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["14–27"," (Rüschige Blüte)",":"]}]," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"display":"inline-block","width":34,"height":14,"borderRadius":7,"background":"#FFAACC","border":"1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.18)","verticalAlign":"middle","marginRight":6}}],"Kreola Nelkenpink"," — Rosarot ist die Grundfarbe dieser echten sternmusternden Petunie."]}],["$","li","Hurrah Rose Star Petunie-28–40-Stängel",{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["28–40"," (Stängel)",":"]}]," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"display":"inline-block","width":34,"height":14,"borderRadius":7,"background":"#5FA777","border":"1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.18)","verticalAlign":"middle","marginRight":6}}],"Kreola Waldgrün"," — Die Stängelfarbe ist bei Petunienvarianten gleich."]}],["$","li","Hurrah Rose Star Petunie-41–53-Blätter und Abschluss",{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":["41–53"," (Blätter und Abschluss)",":"]}]," ",["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","style":{"display":"inline-block","width":34,"height":14,"borderRadius":7,"background":"#1CAC78","border":"1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.18)","verticalAlign":"middle","marginRight":6}}],"Kreola Grün"," — Grüne Blätter vervollständigen diese gemusterte Sorte."]}]]}]]}],["$","article","Frost Fire Rote Petunie",{"style":{"marginBottom":28,"paddingLeft":16,"borderLeft":"3px solid var(--pink-light, #f6a5c0)"